OL,3,GNEWSAFord runs Le Mans hypercar tests
OL,4,Aat Silverstone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ford hypercar, which aims to reclaim
OL,7,Fthe firm's past glory at the iconic Le
OL,8,FMans race, has been put through its
OL,9,Fpaces at Silverstone.
OL,11,FThe US car firm has not entered the top
OL,12,Fcategory of the 24-hour endurance race
OL,13,Ffor nearly 60 years.
OL,15,FIts return in 2027 rekindles memories
OL,16,Fof the famous rivalry with Ferrari in
OL,17,Fthe 1960s, which was the subject of a
OL,18,FHollywood film starring Matt Damon and
OL,19,FChristian Bale.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
